From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 11:16:20 -0643
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: clock: google,zumapro: Add the HSI0 USI4 clocks

Add CMU_HSI0's USI4 clock ids, 28 to 32, appended after USI3's. On the
Pixel 9a USI4 is I2C19, the control bus of the two TAS2572 speaker
amplifiers.

Link: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/google-modules/soc/gs/+/204078758737776959ecc85c527a00fd2cabb62f/drivers/soc/google/cal-if/zuma/cmucal-sfr.c
Signed-off-by: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 include/dt-bindings/clock/google,zumapro.h | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/include/dt-bindings/clock/google,zumapro.h b/include/dt-bindings/clock/google,zumapro.h
index e54d7a6f3..b46da728a 100644
--- a/include/dt-bindings/clock/google,zumapro.h
+++ b/include/dt-bindings/clock/google,zumapro.h
@@ -103,6 +103,11 @@
 #define CLK_DOUT_HSI0_USI3		25
 #define CLK_GOUT_HSI0_USI3_IP		26
 #define CLK_GOUT_HSI0_USI3_PCLK		27
+#define CLK_MOUT_HSI0_USI4_LOCAL	28
+#define CLK_GOUT_HSI0_USI4_SOURCE	29
+#define CLK_DOUT_HSI0_USI4		30
+#define CLK_GOUT_HSI0_USI4_IP		31
+#define CLK_GOUT_HSI0_USI4_PCLK		32
 
 /* CMU_G3D. */
 #define CLK_FOUT_G3D			1
